Run.Description Pristine graphene density of states
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem Graphene

TB.Hopping 3.1

Structure.CellSize 1
Structure.SuperCell 1

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.
Calculate.DOS .true.
Calculate.Bands .false.

Diag.KGrid 30 30 1
Kubo.NumberofEnergyPoints 301
Kubo.Epsilon 0.12
DOS.Emin 0-10.0
DOS.Emax 10.0

TB.NeighLevels 1
Neigh.CompareAll .true.
Stack.NonBulkSmall .true.

Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
